---@class gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.CreateBiddersAccountsFilterSetsRequest
---@field relativeDateRange? gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.RelativeDateRange A relative date range, defined by an offset from today and a duration. Interpreted relative to Pacific time zone.
---@field platforms? gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.FilterSetPlatformsItemEnumList The list of platforms on which to filter; may be empty. The filters represented by multiple platforms are ORed together (for example, if non-empty, results must match any one of the platforms).
---@field publisherIdentifiers? gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.StringList For Open Bidding partners only. The list of publisher identifiers on which to filter; may be empty. The filters represented by multiple publisher identifiers are ORed together.
---@field formats? gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.FilterSetFormatsItemEnumList Creative formats bidded on or allowed to bid on, can be empty. Although this field is a list, it can only be populated with a single item. A HTTP 400 bad request error will be returned in the response if you specify multiple items.
---@field environment? gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.FilterSetEnvironmentEnum|string The environment on which to filter; optional.
---@field dealId? string The ID of the deal on which to filter; optional. This field may be set only for a filter set that accesses account-level troubleshooting data, for example, one whose name matches the `bidders/*/accounts/*/filterSets/*` pattern.
---@field sellerNetworkIds? gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.IntegerList For Authorized Buyers only. The list of IDs of the seller (publisher) networks on which to filter; may be empty. The filters represented by multiple seller network IDs are ORed together (for example, if non-empty, results must match any one of the publisher networks). See [seller-network-ids](https://developers.google.com/authorized-buyers/rtb/downloads/seller-network-ids) file for the set of existing seller network IDs.
---@field breakdownDimensions? gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.FilterSetBreakdownDimensionsItemEnumList The set of dimensions along which to break down the response; may be empty. If multiple dimensions are requested, the breakdown is along the Cartesian product of the requested dimensions.
---@field absoluteDateRange? gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.AbsoluteDateRange An absolute date range, defined by a start date and an end date. Interpreted relative to Pacific time zone.
---@field format? gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.FilterSetFormatEnum|string Creative format bidded on or allowed to bid on, can be empty.
