---@field longValue? string The long value to include/exclude.
---@field creativeSizeValue? gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.CreativeSize The creative size value to include/exclude. Filled in when key = GOOG_CREATIVE_SIZE
---@field dayPartTargetingValue? gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.DayPartTargeting The daypart targeting to include / exclude. Filled in when the key is GOOG_DAYPART_TARGETING. The definition of this targeting is derived from the structure used by Ad Manager.
