---@field videoUrl? string The URL to fetch a video ad.
---@field videoVastXml? string The contents of a VAST document for a video ad. This document should conform to the VAST 2.0 or 3.0 standard.

---Represents targeting information about video.
---@class gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.VideoTargeting
---@field targetedPositionTypes? gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.VideoTargetingTargetedPositionTypesItemEnumList A list of video positions to be included. When the included list is present, the excluded list must be empty. When the excluded list is present, the included list must be empty.
---@field excludedPositionTypes? gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.VideoTargetingExcludedPositionTypesItemEnumList A list of video positions to be excluded. Position types can either be included or excluded (XOR).

---@alias gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.VideoTargetingExcludedPositionTypesItemEnum "POSITION_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"PREROLL"|"MIDROLL"|"POSTROLL"

---@alias gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.VideoTargetingExcludedPositionTypesItemEnumList (gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.VideoTargetingExcludedPositionTypesItemEnum|string)[]

---@alias gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.VideoTargetingTargetedPositionTypesItemEnum "POSITION_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"PREROLL"|"MIDROLL"|"POSTROLL"

---@alias gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.VideoTargetingTargetedPositionTypesItemEnumList (gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.VideoTargetingTargetedPositionTypesItemEnum|string)[]

---@class gcp.adexchangebuyer2_v2beta1.WatchAccountsCreativesRequest
---@field topic? string The Pub/Sub topic to publish notifications to. This topic must already exist and must give permission to ad-exchange-buyside-reports@google.com to write to the topic. This should be the full resource name in "projects/{project_id}/topics/{topic_id}" format.
---@field creativeId string The creative ID to watch for status changes. Specify "-" to watch all creatives under the above account. If both creative-level and account-level notifications are sent, only a single notification will be sent to the creative-level notification topic.
---@field accountId string The account of the creative to watch.

